[l_english.conquest_of_territory_goal_desc]
In a hostile world, expansion is vital to survival. Expansion creates buffer zones and gives us access to more resources.

[l_english.conquest_of_territory_goal_name]
Conquest and Domination

[l_english.protector_of_peace_goal_desc]
Ours is not to get involved in wars in Europe or elsewhere. Instead we should strive to maintain peace, and encourage other countries to settle their disputes peacefully and quickly.

[l_english.protector_of_peace_goal_name]
Protector of Peace

[l_english.regional_expansionism_goal_desc]
Our Faction should take the lead and dominate in [ROOT.GetCountryContinent]

[l_english.regional_expansionism_goal_name]
Expansion in [ROOT.GetCountryContinent]

[l_english.strategic_resource_control_goal_desc]
The one who controls the strategic resources of the world controls the politics of the world.

[l_english.strategic_resource_control_goal_name]
Strategic Resource Control

[l_english.strength_in_unity_goal_desc]
Countries in our corner of the world should stand together. By building a strong faction, we have the best chances possible of remaining independent and neutral.

[l_english.strength_in_unity_goal_name]
Strength in Unity

[l_simp_chinese.conquest_of_territory_goal_desc]
在一个充满敌意的世界里，扩张对生存至关重要。扩张能创造缓冲区，并让我们获得更多资源。

[l_simp_chinese.conquest_of_territory_goal_name]
征服与统治

[l_simp_chinese.protector_of_peace_goal_desc]
我们不应卷入欧洲或其他地区的战争。相反，我们应维护和平，鼓励各国通过和平方式迅速解决争端。

[l_simp_chinese.protector_of_peace_goal_name]
和平守护者

[l_simp_chinese.regional_expansionism_goal_desc]
我们的阵营应领导[ROOT.GetCountryContinent]并占主导地位

[l_simp_chinese.regional_expansionism_goal_name]
在[ROOT.GetCountryContinent]的扩张

[l_simp_chinese.strategic_resource_control_goal_desc]
掌握着世界战略资源者掌握着全世界。

[l_simp_chinese.strategic_resource_control_goal_name]
战略资源控制

[l_simp_chinese.strength_in_unity_goal_desc]
让我们这片土地上的国家紧密团结一致。唯有立一个强大的阵营，我们将拥有保持独立与中立的最佳机会。

[l_simp_chinese.strength_in_unity_goal_name]
团结就是力量
